<%/* Said in the notice once a branch is pushed: what happened, and where the
     pull request is. The page's own row says so too. `it` is the branch. */%>
<p role="status">Pushed <code><%= it.branch %></code> and opened its pull request. Once it’s merged there, Prelude tidies up the branch here.<% if (it.remote?.pulls) { %> <a href="<%= it.remote.pulls %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the pull request<span class="icon icon-external" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><% } %></p>
